  <!--
    No LSUIElement. Phase 5's app was a menu-bar accessory with no window, which suited a
    status dot and suits a control centre badly: the first viewport has to answer five
    questions at a glance, and a panel hanging off the menu bar has neither the room nor the
    permanence for it. This is now a window that opens at login and stays open, with a line in
    the menu bar for the glance when something else is in front of it.
  -->
  <key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
  <true/>
